# Title: Registry Disable System Restore
# ID: 5de03871-5d46-4539-a82d-3aa992a69a83
# Status: test
# Level: high
# Author: frack113
# Date: 2022-04-04
# Tags: attack.impact, attack.t1490
# Description: Detects the modification of the registry to disable a system restore on the computer
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

index=* eventtype=wineventlog ((registry_key_name="*\\Policies\\Microsoft\\Windows NT\\SystemRestore*" OR registry_key_name="*\\Microsoft\\Windows NT\\CurrentVersion\\SystemRestore*") AND (registry_key_name="*DisableConfig" OR registry_key_name="*DisableSR") AND Details="DWORD (0x00000001)")
